#
# OpenSSH server policy for the 0.1.0 remote-access demo.
#
# This is the upstream sshd_config (OpenSSH 10.6p2) with the minimum demo policy:
# root and the unprivileged `raven` account may log in with the image password.
# There is no empty password, no shipped key, and no authorized_keys fallback
# (AuthorizedKeysFile none); the host key is generated at boot and never shipped.
# Do not expose this demo to an untrusted network.
#
# Paths are absolute target paths. The K200 build's compiled-in SSHDIR is an
# absolute host build path, so every file the daemon reads is named here.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PidFile /tmp/sshd.pid
HostKey /tmp/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin yes
AllowUsers root raven
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AuthorizedKeysFile none
StrictModes no
PrintMotd no
UseDNS no
LogLevel INFO
